# deployment secrets
deploy/.env

# Local development secrets. .env.local says of itself "Gitignored. Keep it
# that way: the Google secret below is a real credential" -- and until this
# line it was not, so one `git add -A` would have published it. .history is
# the editor's local-history directory, which keeps a copy of every version
# of every file it has seen, including that one.
.env.local
.history/
.impeccable/

# Security review notes stay out of a public repository: an unfixed finding
# written down here is a map of where to look. Keep them local, or in a
# private tracker, until they are closed.
docs/security-audit.md
